` THE ONE THAT IS NOT A RECTANGLE. one of the things that info mode explains can have a leg: a
` second, smaller rectangle that hangs down from the right end of its bottom edge, so that the two
` together are an upside down L. the bar of the round is that one. its name and its bar go all the
` way across, and its numbers are under the right end of the bar, and the quest of the round is
` under the left end, which is not part of it. see THE BADGE in fish_headers_quests.
` INFO_L_INDEX is which one has the leg, or -1 for none. the outline, the bright outline of the one
` that is highlighted, and the hole in the dark overlay, are each drawn in the shape of the L for it.
` layoutInfoL, in fish_routines_info, lays an outline out that way.
