global TUTORIAL_NUDGE_MS = 6000 `how long the hint waits before it starts to bob, in milliseconds
global TUTORIAL_NUDGE_SIZE = 2 `how far it bobs. it goes up by twice this, and back down to where it sits.
global TUTORIAL_NUDGE_SPEED# = .005 `how fast. it goes up and down once in 6.28 of these, in milliseconds.

` THE HINTS. the three key hints of the game, and the shake that each one gives when the player does
