` THE SONGS. the patterns that have been cast are drawn under the multiplier, small, each one as the shape
` of its walk. there is no label on them. info mode calls them songs, and only once there is one.
` each one is a row of dots, one for every cell of the walk, the color of the specks that drift behind
` the fish, and they twinkle the way that the specks do, so they look like specks that have stopped.
` a fainter line joins every dot to the next one, which is one step of the pattern.
